flowchart TD
  A[Begin checkpoint store] --> B[Open final ckpt-ID.bin with O_TRUNC]
  B --> C[Write native header]
  C --> D[Write target/draft/spec body]
  D --> E[Optional fsync file]
  E --> F[Close]
  F --> G[Rewrite index.bin with O_TRUNC]
  B -. crash .-> P1[Short visible file]
  C -. crash .-> P2[Complete header / short body]
  D -. power loss before durable sync .-> P3[Unknown body durability]
  F -. crash .-> P4[Checkpoint discoverable by scan; index stale]
  G -. crash .-> P5[Partial index; next_id reset risk]
  P1 --> M[MISS]
  P2 --> I[May index metadata] --> M2[MISS on exact body read]
  P3 --> R[No checksum: same-length damage may be undetected]
  P4 --> S[Recovery scan]
  P5 --> S2[Recovery scan + possible sequential ID reuse]
